# The pipeline writes LF (report.html, README's auto-block, JSONs). Without this,
# git checks out CRLF on Windows and a reproduce run shows the tree as dirty even
# though the bytes it produced are correct — pin text to LF so "clean clone ->
# python main.py -> no diff" is a real check, not a line-ending artifact.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.parquet binary
